category: Libs
requires: cygwin libartifastring0 libgcc1 libstdc++6 python3 python312-artifastring
sdesc: "Highly optimized physical simulation of a violin for sound synthesis (utilities)"
ldesc: "Artifastring (artificial fast string) is a highly optimized physical
simulation of string quartet instruments (violins, violas, and cellos) for
sound synthesis."

